[h2]Build 0.9.7[/h2]
[h3]Added[/h3]
[list]
[*][b]Vehicle tube dock[/b] (needs Vehicle Framework): a 3x3 pad on the tube network that vehicles park over. Works with any vehicle mod built on Vehicle Framework, such as Vanilla Vehicles Expanded.
[*][b]Loading:[/b] point tube senders at the dock and what they fire goes straight into the parked vehicle's cargo. Its room is the vehicle's free cargo weight, counting what is already on its way, so it never overfills. Capsules sent while nothing is parked wait on the pad for the next vehicle; empty shells are left beside it.
[*][b]Unloading:[/b] the dock sends the parked vehicle's cargo, a capsule at a time, to a receiver you choose, with a filter for what to take off. Each capsule uses an empty shell that haulers bring to the pad.
[*]It only works on your own vehicles once they have stopped, never touches passengers, and leaves a vehicle alone while it is being packed for a caravan.
[/list]
